The fonts embedded in src/fonts/unbounded_black.h and src/fonts/jetbrains_mono.h
are subsets of Unbounded Black, Copyright 2022 The Unbounded Project Authors,
and JetBrains Mono ExtraBold, Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors.
Both are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 and are not covered by the
MIT license above. The license texts ship in licenses/OFL-Unbounded.txt and
licenses/OFL-JetBrainsMono.txt.

src/stb_truetype.h keeps its own public domain or MIT terms, stated inside the
file, and is not covered by the MIT license above.

The STL models in enclosure/ are the author's own work and are not covered by
the MIT license above.

The firmware is intended for adults. It contains sarcasm, rude jokes and mild
insults. It is not intended for children. The setup page requires the user to
confirm they are 18 years old or older.

This is an independent project. It is not made, endorsed, sponsored or supported
by M5Stack. M5Stack and M5PaperColor are trademarks of their respective owners.

Settings and Wi-Fi credentials are stored in NVS on the device. The firmware
contains no telemetry, analytics or update checks. The only outbound network
traffic is NTP. Anyone within radio range can join the setup access point while
setup mode is open.

This is version one. It may contain flaws. The software controls a lithium
battery and a power management IC; modifications to the power path or shutdown
logic are made at the user's own risk.
